The independent quality review of JerryScript (`jerry-core/` and `jerry-ext/` at commit `5fdeb7c1d68e8c5209e186e1760bc703a723d588`) is complete.

- **Full report (with file paths, line numbers, mechanisms, and reproducers):** [BUG-HUNT-REPORT.md](file:///mnt/c/Users/danie/swesweep-parasoft-benchmark/repos/jerryscript/BUG-HUNT-REPORT.md)
- **Totals:** **78 findings** (**65 CONFIRMED** via debug + ASan/UBSan JS/C repros, **13 SUSPECTED** argued from source): **13 Critical**, **30 High**, **35 Medium**.
- **Workspace state:** Clean tracked tree (no tracked files modified, nothing committed or pushed); all work executed in the main thread.

